# SwiftReply Backend 🚀

A production-ready AI-powered backend built with **FastAPI**, supporting:
- Chat AI assistant
- Voice chat
- Image analysis & generation
- File uploads
- Memory system (long-term AI memory)
- Payments (M-Pesa + PayPal ready)
- Subscriptions system
- Notifications
- Analytics dashboard
- OAuth authentication
- JWT security

---

## ⚙️ Tech Stack

- FastAPI
- PostgreSQL + SQLAlchemy
- Alembic (migrations)
- OpenAI API
- Firebase (push notifications)
- Cloudinary (file storage)
- M-Pesa Daraja API
- Resend (email service)
- Docker

---

